OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day with some evening sunshine.
OL,7,FClear spells overnight, though some
OL,8,Fareas of low cloud will reform, giving
OL,9,Fsome hill fog over the Moors. Another
OL,10,Fwarm night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FWednesday looks fine. Early
OL,13,Flow cloud and hill fog clearing to
OL,14,Fleave plenty of sunny spells. However,
OL,15,Ffurther cloud edging in from the
OL,16,Fnorthwest later. Hot and feeling humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
